            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle inni ha gabbinna isii ch'ufa fooni iraa baase, akuma hori sorio wold'ageetiti qalani gabbinna iraa baasani; akasuma waan mesa fakaata irati ha gubu, duuba akasiini ch'inch'aani isi AABBO Waaqa gammachiifti. Kara kanaani qaallichi sorio daba nama sunitini baasani baase, daba isa isaa araaramani.",
          "type": "text",
